# Experiment 09 - sample requests
# Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request",
# or copy the same method/URL/body into Postman or Thunder Client.

@base = http://localhost:5001

### List all projects
GET {{base}}/api/projects

### Get one project
GET {{base}}/api/projects/1

### Create a project
POST {{base}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Quiz App", "stack": "React, Node", "rating": 5 }

### Delete a project
DELETE {{base}}/api/projects/2

### Submit the contact form
POST {{base}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rahul Kumar", "email": "rahul@example.com", "message": "Hi, interested in collaborating on a project." }

### Validation error (missing fields) -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test" }

### Admin view of submitted messages
GET {{base}}/api/messages
